<node id="Core Algorithm Update">
  <data key="d0">Core Algorithm Update</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A core algorithm update is a significant change by the search engine that can cause websites to lose rankings if they have quality issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Core Algorithm Update is a Google algorithm update that refreshes the search network, after which traffic and rankings can significantly change.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a2c4e2ae1837755693d47d4e276e0fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b995c5d7fab964c7a148a75f0272e270</data>
