<node id="Website">
  <data key="d0">Website</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The website is the online property being optimized, which has rankings and can be affected by algorithm updates.&lt;SEP&gt;The online platform where content is published, must consistently reflect the central search intent.&lt;SEP&gt;Website is the online presence crawled by search engines, competing for rankings within a knowledge domain.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of web pages that can be queried by AI systems; its information organization affects answer quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The website is the final output of the data-to-website methodology, which must be internally consistent.&lt;SEP&gt;The speaker's website with extensive research.</data>
