<node id="The Speaker">
  <data key="d0">The Speaker</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The speaker is the inventor of the topical map concept and provides training on semantic SEO through YouTube and other platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;The Speaker is the presenter of the lecture, who explains topics, checks articles, and expresses hope for audience enjoyment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Speaker is an SEO expert who shares case studies and insights on semantic SEO, content strategy, and understanding search engines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Speaker is an SEO expert who emphasizes understanding over imitation, has a course, and uses case studies without relying on tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f0632b547a34e2bc896a85a73634711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff65f727135659538eed14f8dcf24d1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a99a29e62de16c6682606a21ab6928</data>
