  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Publication date is used for creating momentum in a topical map.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication date is the scheduled date when an article is published, indicated by green color after publication.&lt;SEP&gt;Publication Date is the date when articles are published, relevant to scheduling and frequency.</data>
