<node id="Semantic SEO">
  <data key="d0">Semantic SEO</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Semantic SEO is the field where vastness, depth, and momentum are fundamental principles.&lt;SEP&gt;Semantic SEO is an advanced approach to search engine optimization that involves understanding query parsing, topical maps, and knowledge domains.&lt;SEP&gt;The practice of optimizing content to be classified with top authorities and build topical authority.&lt;SEP&gt;A search engine optimization approach focusing on meaning and context, the subject of the course.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-601527952de3e4cb533d4928c1d0ad26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0d0818187343a7c01c321335563cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f0b337786fa9ac6737c59cfd3e508</data>
