<node id="Entity">
  <data key="d0">Entity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Entity is a fundamental unit in a topical map, paired with attributes.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity is a core subject or object within a topical map, such as water, that can have various attributes and connections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f812c017168e90729b20b23af0336de</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779794418</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Attribute">
  <data key="d0">Attribute</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Attribute is a characteristic paired with an entity in a topical map.&lt;SEP&gt;A characteristic of the central entity, with the most important attribute prioritized in the outer topical map.&lt;SEP&gt;An Attribute is a characteristic or property of an entity, used in query formation and filtering.&lt;SEP&gt;Attributes are elements connected to the root document in a semantic content network.&lt;SEP&gt;An attribute is a characteristic or property of an entity, like benefit or amount, that helps define query networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af889bef5a28b1d36ff3bfa5d0ea5714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-601527952de3e4cb533d4928c1d0ad26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90e8d2e8886f2d086271b65b8c1a3253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f812c017168e90729b20b23af0336de</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779794418</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Germany">
  <data key="d0">Germany</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Germany is a country in Europe that is consistently employed as a central, unifying example entity across a wide range of illustrative scenarios in lectures and demonstrations. It serves as the core subject in topical maps, where content is systematically organized around it, and in discussions of URL structure, with subpages covering themes such as life, culture, visa, religion, language schools, and working opportunities arranged under its name. This role extends to internal linking strategies, where Germany is the focus of a network of related pages.

In explorations of political themes, Germany provides a sample context for examining elections and the relevance of religious political parties. It is also used to investigate city-level data, specifically contrasting the safest and most dangerous cities within the country. Query-oriented illustrations feature Germany as an entity with measurable attributes like population and minimum wage, and it is highlighted to demonstrate attribute prominence, showcasing characteristics such as its football league and basketball league alongside population figures. Additionally, Germany appears in examples defining a country through question types and query terms, and it is the country specified in a question about the duration of language education.

Further contextual uses include Germany as the location of Humboldt University, and as an example where a particular query might exist while a similar one does not for France. Across all these instances, Germany functions as a consistent reference point to clarify concepts in information architecture, content organization, data modeling, and query design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e7da857e573232b8497dce8e12f896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39990f5d947195d523433912663e75da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e988e4c8d8d4c34d496747edf41f541d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6fcf117c831329dacb93b241158f58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-601527952de3e4cb533d4928c1d0ad26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beff6e5691c00d2a3ced912957383f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90e8d2e8886f2d086271b65b8c1a3253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-067d4f226ffbbfab6cf2dbc297b6289c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575a42261e7ed1bc18d072052828622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66b6eab94f52b9bb0e353a781becd4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721fd7360c4042bb96070adb318d92eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e745285933563d1ddbb9665a9120ab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9edf2abec867ee2a44168ee963aa04e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779808257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Religion">
  <data key="d0">Religion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Religion is an attribute of Germany in the topical map example.&lt;SEP&gt;An attribute of Germany used in the outdoor section to provide broader context.&lt;SEP&gt;An attribute under culture.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic that appears in the context of life in Germany, and could be moved to politics, changing its contextual meaning.&lt;SEP&gt;Religion is a topic that, when categorized under politics, changes the context and title tags of a website.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4984238e80fca08ac8084d07036b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e7da857e573232b8497dce8e12f896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af889bef5a28b1d36ff3bfa5d0ea5714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e988e4c8d8d4c34d496747edf41f541d</data>
