  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Politics is an attribute of Germany in the topical map example.&lt;SEP&gt;An attribute of Germany used in the outdoor section.&lt;SEP&gt;An attribute under culture, also connected to flag and official languages.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic that could contain religion, altering its interpretation to a political issue.&lt;SEP&gt;Politics is a broader category that can encompass religion, affecting the classification of a website as political.&lt;SEP&gt;Politics is an important attribute related to Germany.</data>
