<node id="Visa">
  <data key="d0">Visa</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Visa is a type of attribute that forms the core section of the topical map for Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;A permit that is the monetization focus; the core section revolves around visa-related topics.&lt;SEP&gt;Visa is a topic placed at the end of descriptions, serving as a micro context.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic in the URL structure, under which culture is placed, and which is linked from the life section.</data>
