  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Visa types include D type visa, C type visa, touristic visa, family visit visa, work permit, job seeking visa, immigration, embassies, consulates, citizenship, residency, language learning visa, etc., and are processed in the core section.</data>
