  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The outdoor section of a topical map is flat and does not go deep into sub-attributes.&lt;SEP&gt;The part of the topical map that unifies the central entity with predicates, providing broader contextual relevance and linking to the core section.</data>
