<node id="Topicality">
  <data key="d0">Topicality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The thematic consistency of a website, reinforced by side-wide phrases and engrams.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall subject matter of a web page, determined by the aggregation of terms in title tags.&lt;SEP&gt;Topicality refers to the overall subject relevance of a webpage, which meta descriptions can help reflect.</data>
