</node>
<node id="Title Tag">
  <data key="d0">Title Tag</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An SEO element that is a processed, verbalized version of a raw topical map, used to reflect macro and micro contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTML element that reflects the macro context and changes based on the URL structure and topic placement.&lt;SEP&gt;Title tag is an HTML element that reflects the macro context and changes based on how topics like religion are categorized.&lt;SEP&gt;The Title Tag is an HTML element that defines the title of a webpage and determines the macro context.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTML element that defines the title of a webpage, connected to the source context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39990f5d947195d523433912663e75da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e988e4c8d8d4c34d496747edf41f541d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6fcf117c831329dacb93b241158f58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dbcb974ac562086c1749ecf22ea07f4</data>
