  <data key="d0">Semantic Astro Course</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A course that includes a lecture on URL structure and semantic content networks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Semantic Astro Course is an educational program that includes lectures on semantic content networks and methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Semantic Astro Course is a series of lectures focusing on semantic content networks, heading hierarchy, and contextual connections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721fd7360c4042bb96070adb318d92eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6ee67e32c07c0182dd83e65b717d89d</data>
