<node id="Search Engine Crawlers">
  <data key="d0">Search Engine Crawlers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated programs that browse the web to index content, with URL structure being the first thing they encounter.&lt;SEP&gt;Search engine crawlers are systems that browse and index websites, with crawl rate correlating with positive rankings.&lt;SEP&gt;Search engine crawlers are bots that may ignore specific internal links if they do not change their crawling behaviors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575a42261e7ed1bc18d072052828622</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779793356</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
