  <data key="d0">Seed</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The middle layer in the semantic content network, representing major subsections that expand further.&lt;SEP&gt;A Seed is a foundational element in the topical authority methodology, alongside root and node.</data>
