  <data key="d2">The bottom layer in the semantic content network, representing individual content pieces that link to upper layers and sometimes each other.&lt;SEP&gt;A Node is a connected element in the internal link structure, along with root and seed.&lt;SEP&gt;Node is a component in the topical map representing an attribute like population, which can be verbalized into content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84be65ef542a67b8c7039f750beecb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc92a7015e647914eacacd758a036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beff6e5691c00d2a3ced912957383f87</data>
