<node id="Search Demand">
  <data key="d0">Search Demand</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Search Demand is the level of user interest in a topic, used to decide whether to create a new page.&lt;SEP&gt;Search demand is the basis for attribute popularity, indicating how often an attribute is searched.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e6fcf117c831329dacb93b241158f58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beff6e5691c00d2a3ced912957383f87</data>
