<node id="Authority">
  <data key="d0">Authority</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Authority is the credibility and ranking power of a domain, influencing the decision to create new pages.&lt;SEP&gt;A signal of trustworthiness and expertise, associated with government websites during the pandemic.&lt;SEP&gt;Authority refers to the perceived expertise and trustworthiness of a content source.&lt;SEP&gt;Authority is the perceived expertise and trustworthiness of content, demonstrated through research, numeric values, and citations.&lt;SEP&gt;Authority refers to the credibility and influence of a web page or source, enhanced by using authoritative research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e6fcf117c831329dacb93b241158f58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ead1494c17202662c334ce26d68202b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad6b0780f4ae2de415293f3a5c7c523&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b615b5774407c34f6346573e110fff4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-176ba103322e465c5c762eb258005dd2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
