<node id="Publication Frequency">
  <data key="d0">Publication Frequency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Publication Frequency is the rate at which content is published, a topic for a future lecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Publication frequency is the schedule and pattern of publishing content, created through a publication diet, to capture search engine attention.&lt;SEP&gt;Publication Frequency is the schedule and pattern of publishing articles, including batch sizes and intervals.&lt;SEP&gt;Publication frequency is the regular schedule of publishing content on a topic to gain search engine attention.</data>
