  <data key="d0">Antonym</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An Antonym is a word with opposite meaning, used in supplementary content to maintain topical relevance.&lt;SEP&gt;Antonym is a word with opposite meaning, used in content (e.g., unconstipate as antonym of constipate).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e6fcf117c831329dacb93b241158f58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7299ff5f066dee74796eab27e8c910</data>
