<node id="Core Algorithm Updates">
  <data key="d0">Core Algorithm Updates</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Core algorithm updates are major search engine changes that redefine the upper and lower limits of rank ability.&lt;SEP&gt;Updates to Google's algorithm that recalculate definitions, angles, and contacts for word groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Updates to search engine algorithms that assess content quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a2bd575df4c8a0d322e5adcf2e78bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aea7abfa9cae709ad280790ed42d424</data>
