</node>
<node id="Flat Algorithmic Season">
  <data key="d0">Flat Algorithmic Season</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Flat algorithmic season is a period without core algorithm updates, considered ideal for launching new projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779791293</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Of Ranking">
  <data key="d0">Cost Of Ranking</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost of ranking is the principle that the expense for a search engine to rank a website must not exceed the cost of not ranking it.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost of ranking is the computational expense for a search engine to rank a website, which should be lower than the cost of not ranking it.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce3b3b0a54222d30ae8e21605e0a3a2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809706</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Of Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Cost Of Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost of retrieval is the foundational concept behind topical authority, focusing on the efficiency of information retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;The cost associated with retrieving information, which can be decreased by quality pages.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost of retrieval is the effort a search engine expends to find and rank information; lowering it benefits the website.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0d0818187343a7c01c321335563cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9ca968c07a96f9bfe4f63b31908aca6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809763</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
