<node id="Crawl Rate">
  <data key="d0">Crawl Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Crawl rate is the frequency at which search engine crawlers visit a website, correlating with positive rankings.&lt;SEP&gt;Crawl Rate is the frequency at which search engines crawl a website, which can be increased by publishing quality article batches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cb0443852c88f9233a38374df7483b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1fce491355836fb3f209fcf0e07ba64</data>
