<node id="Author">
  <data key="d0">Author</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An author is a person assigned to write articles, indicated by yellow color.&lt;SEP&gt;The Author is the person who writes the content after the structure is determined and needs training.&lt;SEP&gt;The author is the person who writes articles and may need to be forced to use context hints and phrase sequences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faa3a31ed6d949d0ce7054a0833ddb04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043bc92a7015e647914eacacd758a036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ae1f1b49055c6666741019f9fa17ae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779796077</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Article">
  <data key="d0">Article</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The term "Article" refers both to a general concept within a semantic content network and to a specific written piece used as an illustrative example. In its general sense, an Article is a written work produced from a specific brief and published as part of a semantic content network. It follows a defined article methodology, with its structure comprising macro context, micro context, and a summary. The Article serves as a source text that can represent itself, and from which summaries are generated. It is also recommended as a resource for understanding entity–attribute–value triples, and its own methodology is a subject of discussion. 

A specific instance of an Article is the main piece under discussion, which focuses on the topic of water intoxication. This particular Article is about drinking water and is structured with headings and paragraphs, exemplifying the general article format. Thus, "Article" encompasses both the overarching content model and the concrete example that illustrates it.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being created based on the content brief and contextual vector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faa3a31ed6d949d0ce7054a0833ddb04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beff6e5691c00d2a3ced912957383f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbac222e7b9f4ed501578b6503d7e819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9819cf025207d885301e2eb37c93e99e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c6c0977e83a555c288951c70d42e339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-291afa9bbbeab0842d299e3a83bd26b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2002fbb248a146a783e2d25d0a26b5e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc3b08eaa821f490808f28acdb3427f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f3737ebb9deefae951ea2e92ccc158</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809026</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time">
  <data key="d0">Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time is emphasized as an important resource, saved by using the color-coding system.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporal resources that limited the ability to process all content directly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faa3a31ed6d949d0ce7054a0833ddb04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237f0369c76d4e73efce226fd0388537</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779800928</data>
