  <data key="d0">Jump Links</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Links that navigate to a specific subsection of a URL, associated with hash identifiers.&lt;SEP&gt;Jump links are numeric links used to connect references to text; the speaker considers them irrelevant to the topic.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0dbcb974ac562086c1749ecf22ea07f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-176ba103322e465c5c762eb258005dd2</data>
