<node id="Listing">
  <data key="d0">Listing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A content format using HTML ordered or unordered lists for instructions, keywords, or comparisons.&lt;SEP&gt;The items presented in a specific order as part of the list definition.&lt;SEP&gt;Listing is a method of presenting items in a structured list format to convey information clearly.</data>
