<node id="Definitive Answer">
  <data key="d0">Definitive Answer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A certain and direct answer in a single sentence, leaving no room for possibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;An exact answer provided in the article, often supported by evidence.</data>
