<node id="Seconds Modeling">
  <data key="d0">Seconds Modeling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A technique for fine-tuning language models by including specific word sequences to affect context.&lt;SEP&gt;Seconds modeling is a technique involving the analysis of word sequences and their probabilities, used to understand query structures and improve content optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0dbcb974ac562086c1749ecf22ea07f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45a2a27d5f61609219a67e6c845917a7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779799960</data>
