  <data key="d0">Include Term By Protecting Context</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A rule in content briefs that requires including a specific term while preserving its context, often using quotation marks to group words together.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0dbcb974ac562086c1749ecf22ea07f4</data>
