  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Future Lectures will cover detailed explanations of the Quarice Framework's components.&lt;SEP&gt;Upcoming lectures that will include language model trainings and exploration of other projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Future lectures are upcoming educational sessions that will cover heating hierarchy and anchor text.&lt;SEP&gt;Future lectures are upcoming educational sessions where the article's methodology will be discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;Future lectures are upcoming sessions where the instructor will publish videos and conduct another article check.&lt;SEP&gt;Future lectures will cover different projects, explanations, and concepts, continuing the journey.</data>
