<node id="Heading Levels">
  <data key="d0">Heading Levels</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heading Levels such as H4, H3, HY4 are used to structure content and influence link weight.&lt;SEP&gt;Heading levels are used to structure content and affect the prominence of internal links.</data>
