<node id="List Format">
  <data key="d0">List Format</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">List Format is a content formatting method specified by the Contextual Structure, including sentences before and after the list.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured list format used after H2 headings to present multiple items, often accompanied by images.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-043bc92a7015e647914eacacd758a036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1177eff05fcacbefb5fcf5b925177e</data>
