<node id="Document">
  <data key="d0">Document</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The overall written content whose contextuality is maintained by the contextual structure.&lt;SEP&gt;A piece of content, such as an article, that can be retrieved and summarized by AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The document refers to the entire web page being optimized.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ad882cdccd8e0beb9a3d86482839006&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aa4f955c977e4411acda6af90a1e984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8122ad3e878784e98cdd0c33cb998553</data>
