<node id="Section">
  <data key="d0">Section</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A part of the document that should be richer than competitors but not too deep, except for specific contextual domains.&lt;SEP&gt;A section is a part of an article that can provide summaries of entire areas, sub parts, or sub roots of sub sections.&lt;SEP&gt;Section is the whole section of content that is reconnected to after presenting effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ad882cdccd8e0beb9a3d86482839006&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8869133cffd3a4667b0bce46eca871&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00b04208cc4996300395be0f94b9e104</data>
