  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Search Engine Optimization; future SEO requires organizing information with contextual flow and coverage to rank in chat generators and search results.&lt;SEP&gt;SEO is search engine optimization, the practice of improving website rankings.</data>
