<node id="General Summary">
  <data key="d0">General Summary</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A summary of the entire article, part of the macro context area that touches all subsections.&lt;SEP&gt;The general summary is an output that repeats the elements from the macro context in the same order.&lt;SEP&gt;General summary is a type of summary used for web page site contextual consolidation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6aa4f955c977e4411acda6af90a1e984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ae1f1b49055c6666741019f9fa17ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8122ad3e878784e98cdd0c33cb998553</data>
