<node id="Prominence">
  <data key="d0">Prominence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The importance or visibility of a document part, influenced by links and contextual coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Prominence refers to the importance of a topic, used to order content sections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6aa4f955c977e4411acda6af90a1e984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693450104ff13d2ef5a1111365e8c7e7</data>
