  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indicators like relevance and prominence that search engines use to rank content.&lt;SEP&gt;Signals are specific types of results or indicators from Google searches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6aa4f955c977e4411acda6af90a1e984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3b62e9a672b017589bbc9685367180</data>
