<node id="Abstractive Summary">
  <data key="d0">Abstractive Summary</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Abstractive summary is a type of summary that, if not properly created, indicates broken points in the article; referred to as "obstructive summary" in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Abstractive Summary is a summary that imagines the rest of the article in an abstract way, used when the full article is not yet written.&lt;SEP&gt;Abstractive Summary is a technique for summarizing content by generating new phrases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bbac222e7b9f4ed501578b6503d7e819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c6c0977e83a555c288951c70d42e339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693450104ff13d2ef5a1111365e8c7e7</data>
