<node id="Subsections">
  <data key="d0">Subsections</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Subsections are the parts of the article that the macro context must touch.&lt;SEP&gt;Subsections are parts of a webpage where certain terms may or may not appear.&lt;SEP&gt;The divisions within the article, between which contextual transitions occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Divisions within the article created using H3 and H4 tags.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bbac222e7b9f4ed501578b6503d7e819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68b6216c51b8b71b22fb85e4c681c6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbedcd7bd86eeb3e840ab8d2ece81dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f3737ebb9deefae951ea2e92ccc158</data>
