<node id="Svalbard">
  <data key="d0">Svalbard</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A project (likely a website) that was ranked against Healthline and WebMD using only 27 articles.&lt;SEP&gt;A website or brand that aims to establish topical authority by outranking top health authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Svalbard is an entity that gains authority through the repeated application of the topical map methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;Svalbard is a brand that is both a luxury water brand and an Arctic water brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Svalbard is an archipelago in the Arctic, mentioned as a source for luxury bottled water, used to connect to benefits of drinking water.&lt;SEP&gt;Svalbard is a place or tool referenced for observing the use of part of speech tags in certain types of lists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c014d35d8d2fc2d10ceb8a1f6a08dde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0d0818187343a7c01c321335563cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f812c017168e90729b20b23af0336de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044463b06024487bc6e52187cb1877de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5d7082c2385428e0799d39afec90f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce3b3b0a54222d30ae8e21605e0a3a2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809696</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Healthline">
  <data key="d0">Healthline</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthline is a prominent health information website recognized as a top authority in the health industry. It is consistently identified as a primary competitor in search rankings, specifically targeted by initiatives such as the Svalbard project and the Health Niche Website Project, both of which aim to outrank it. Beyond its competitive role, Healthline is utilized as a source within content briefs and serves as a practical example for creating contextual vectors, notably featuring a target web page about the pH of water.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthline is a health information website that the content aims to be classified with.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthline is an authoritative YMYL niche website in the English language, from which articles are taking clicks.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthline is a major health information website that The Health Website competes against.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthline is a global authority in the health niche and a competitor to the author's health website.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c014d35d8d2fc2d10ceb8a1f6a08dde8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2d85a4677a5d3970bc9c3a12963a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0d0818187343a7c01c321335563cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5630eb292b2067508ab2e5051ecbe6e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f3c23ae818c0fb16bb3e6e223b4e918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad6b0780f4ae2de415293f3a5c7c523&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac0b51fe0e8ae2f09eae48deeb65f256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad49d2ec5b75756ff8ac96a9e0a07d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab08862cb455a716bef38bcdb6db556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f0632b547a34e2bc896a85a73634711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b995c5d7fab964c7a148a75f0272e270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff65f727135659538eed14f8dcf24d1f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809707</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
