<node id="Distilled Water">
  <data key="d0">Distilled Water</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Distilled water is a type of water discussed in terms of its safety and health benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled water is a purified type of water mentioned as an option for drinking hot.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled water is purified water often compared with tap water in pH-related queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled water is a type of water that appears frequently in queries and is compared with tap water, leading to its placement in the first section.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of purified water, used as an example (A13) to connect to bottled water subtypes.</data>
