  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sparkling water is a type of water whose benefits are included in the topical map.&lt;SEP&gt;Sparkling water is carbonated water, relevant to pH comparisons in query networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Sparkling water is carbonated water with a specific pH level.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonated water, a product with high search demand, connected to the bottled water brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Sparkling water is a popular type of water, linked to drinking water as an alternative.&lt;SEP&gt;Sparkling water is a type of carbonated water mentioned as a specific section in the lecture.</data>
