  <data key="d0">Generative Ai</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generative AI is a type of AI that can create content, impacting the effectiveness of mass article publishing.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI is a future technology that can be leveraged through proper article methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI is a technology that will make it easier to implement context hints in the near future.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI is a technology that includes chain of reasoning and natural language inferring capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems that generate content, used as an example for prompt context adjustment.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI refers to AI systems like GPT that can generate text, understand, infer, extract, and connect information.</data>
