<node id="Luxury Water">
  <data key="d0">Luxury Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Luxury water is a type of water that serves as the source context in the project, characterized by higher price and attributes like Arctic water.&lt;SEP&gt;Luxury water is a high-end water category included in the discussion of hot water types.&lt;SEP&gt;Luxury water refers to premium bottled water brands, connected to pH-related content for relevance.&lt;SEP&gt;Luxury water is a type of water, connected to sparkling water and source context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-044463b06024487bc6e52187cb1877de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c10223fd9ea5d44bdbd29c6221184f67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce47151a2b89b01b7efea15668a4972c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab08862cb455a716bef38bcdb6db556</data>
