<node id="Arctic Water">
  <data key="d0">Arctic Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Arctic water is a type of water that is relatively more expensive and is an attribute of luxury water, associated with the Svalbard brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Arctic water is a premium type of water referenced in the content about hot water varieties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-044463b06024487bc6e52187cb1877de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c10223fd9ea5d44bdbd29c6221184f67</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
