  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Drinking Water">
  <data key="d0">Drinking Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Drinking Water is a multifaceted term with two primary interpretations: it refers both to a type of water that is safe for human consumption and to the act of consuming that water. As a type of water, it is defined as water that can be drunk safely, providing the essential benefit of sustaining life for organisms. This concept serves as a central entity and search intent for an entire website, where its definition and benefits are structured within an article's methodology. It is also used as an annotation example to illustrate such a safe water kind. As an action, drinking water is the process of consuming water, which yields numerous health benefits, including improved physical performance, increased energy, enhanced brain function, and weight loss. The topic is discussed in articles that cover these benefits and daily intake recommendations, and it appears as a subject at the end of a related lecture. Thus, the term encompasses both the substance and the predicate, with its significance highlighted across content briefs and educational materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Consumable water that influences the body's water percentage and daily intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Drinking water is water safe for consumption, the main topic context for discussing pH levels and health implications.&lt;SEP&gt;Drinking water is water safe for consumption, with varying pH levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Drinking water is the main subject, with discussions on pH, safety, and types.&lt;SEP&gt;The central practice of consuming water, used as the main entity in the content hierarchy and connected to various health benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Drinking water is a topic related to the importance of water, found in search results.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-044463b06024487bc6e52187cb1877de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89ba62f2b9f725725fe8219a87ffad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c6c0977e83a555c288951c70d42e339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ae1f1b49055c6666741019f9fa17ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7299ff5f066dee74796eab27e8c910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ead1494c17202662c334ce26d68202b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8122ad3e878784e98cdd0c33cb998553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef1d53ea2fafdb6002975ead6658b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b46a5ce46cdcaba690c43278c43e6956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce47151a2b89b01b7efea15668a4972c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a862d8cd031c8ba43a92cd09c11ae3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab08862cb455a716bef38bcdb6db556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c416bcd7aedd056158284b55f461171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec8e7c18c9c9fd7ef5951e6635b00e42</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779809685</data>
