  <data key="d0">Context Vectors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Context vectors are vectors that will be examined in the next lecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors are representations of contextual meaning used in search algorithms.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors are signals or representations obtained from Google searches related to nutrients and water.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors are a concept related to the organization of context in content, part of the Corrace framework.</data>
