  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Feature Snippet is a search engine result format that highlights a direct answer, influenced by page rank and candidate answer passage scoring.&lt;SEP&gt;A Feature Snippet is a highlighted search result that the content structure aims to capture.</data>
