  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The concept that in ranking, the winner is the one who understands micro semantics deeply.&lt;SEP&gt;Comparative ranking is a methodology where competitors vie for higher rankings by using better sentence structures and frequency of terms.</data>
