  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The broader semantic elements like contextual hierarchy, vector, and contextual bridges.&lt;SEP&gt;The overarching semantic meaning derived from macro context in content.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro semantics is a high-level semantic structure used to define main content sections and contextual zones.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a2bd575df4c8a0d322e5adcf2e78bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ead1494c17202662c334ce26d68202b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c10223fd9ea5d44bdbd29c6221184f67</data>
