  <data key="d2">Constipation is a condition that can be relieved by drinking water, with dehydration being a common cause.&lt;SEP&gt;Constipation is a related health condition that appears in the article and is connected to digestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Constipation is a digestive condition mentioned in a specific section of the article, associated with mineral water and infants.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition that can be treated by drinking water, especially when caused by insufficient fluid intake.</data>
