  <data key="d0">Water Percentage In Body</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water percentage in body is the topic of how much water constitutes the human body, often expressed as a percentage.&lt;SEP&gt;The proportion of water in the human body, a central topic in the article methodology, with variations based on gender, age, geography, and diet.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic related to the amount of water in the human body, discussed in the content.</data>
