<node id="Weight Loss">
  <data key="d0">Weight Loss</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Weight Loss is a process involving the reduction of body weight, which can be supported by drinking water. Water consumption may aid weight loss by increasing feelings of fullness, thereby potentially reducing overall calorie intake. This benefit is associated with both regular water and hot water, with the latter specifically cited as a claimed advantage within the heating vector. Additionally, weight loss is connected to metabolism rate and is the subject of a specific H3 question, highlighting its relevance in broader discussions about hydration and health.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5630eb292b2067508ab2e5051ecbe6e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef1d53ea2fafdb6002975ead6658b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f678064163d41d8196871b5a23c9069c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b837e1fc804bb7df2114c65c3758ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ad6b0780f4ae2de415293f3a5c7c523&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aea7abfa9cae709ad280790ed42d424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c416bcd7aedd056158284b55f461171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e745285933563d1ddbb9665a9120ab7</data>
