  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lexical semantics is the study of word meanings and relationships, used to generate question variations.&lt;SEP&gt;The study of word meanings, used to transition from human body to animal bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;The study of word meanings and relationships, used to connect queries to specific sections.&lt;SEP&gt;Lexical semantics is the meaning of words and their relationships, considered after query semantics.</data>
